ently in this respect. So the word for "newest" can evidently be simply (}{\b\lang1033 an}{\lang1033 - + }{\b\lang1033 vinya}{\lang1033  =) }{\b\lang1033 anvinya}{\lang1033 . Even if it was }{\b\lang1033 anwinya}{\lang1033 
